The source passages are not covered by that licence. Each passage is taken from a GOV.UK
guidance page and is used under the Open Government Licence v3.0:
https://www.nationalarchives.gov.uk/doc/open-government-licence/version/3/

Every passage record in passages.jsonl carries its source URL, page title, retrieval date
and the attribution statement the licence requires:

  Contains public sector information licensed under the Open Government Licence v3.0.

Anyone reusing a passage, or an answer adapted from one, must keep that attribution.
